      "## Option 3: A managed AI calling agent (from $1,499 setup + $399/mo)",
      "The managed route is the same technology as option 1, with the work moved to the agency: the agent is scripted on your services, prices and criteria; it qualifies callers, books into your real calendar, writes summaries into your CRM, and is monitored and tuned from real calls. Our own AI calling agents are published in three tiers: a receptionist agent on one number from $1,499 setup plus $399 a month (300 minutes included), a Standard agent with outbound reminders and CRM integration at $3,499 setup plus $899 a month (1,000 minutes included), and a Premium tier with outbound campaign capability at $7,999 setup plus $2,499 a month. The honest case for paying more than a self-serve tool is not better AI — it is that setup, integration and monitoring are done for you, and complex calls transfer to a human instead of failing in front of a customer.",
